/* The CE script API the port implements, by API-reference.txt and ScriptingReadme.txt names. The launcher refuses a level whose
 * scripts use a CE name missing here; script_bindings_tests proves every entry exists in a VM.
 * JPT_API(owner, name, kind, capability): owner "" is the root table.
 * JPT_HANDLER(scopes, name, capability): a handler the port calls on the scripts of those kinds (G game, L level, I instance). */
